3-u002","layer":"body","order":4,"page_id":"p003","review_status":"ai-initial-unreviewed","role":"body","text":"在廣州府有一人家、姓李名令、經商營運、謀利積庫盈囊就厚","uncertainties":[]},{"bbox":null,"gaps":[],"id":"p003-u003","layer":"body","order":5,"page_id":"p003","review_status":"ai-initial-unreviewed","role":"body","text":"食濃味、逸樂度日。身衣錦綉、日飫珍饈、耳聽管絃之聲、目睹燕","uncertainties":[]},{"bbox":null,"gaps":[],"id":"p003-u004","layer":"body","order":6,"page_id":"p003","review_status":"ai-initial-unreviewed","role":"body","text":"之色、沉湎酣歌。如此蹈縱恣之慾、而不悟非覺也。且說他的隣","uncertainties":[{"candidates":["湎","酒"],"length":1,"offset":4,"reason":"The right-hand component is unclear in the full-page image. It looks like either 湎 or 酒; check against a detail crop."}]},{"bbox":null,"gaps":[],"id":"p003-u005","layer":"body","order":7,"page_id":"p003","review_status":"ai-initial-unreviewed","role":"body","text":"姓劉名岱、爲君子、只可恨家道窮乏、口腹是急、往往饑寒逼身","uncertainties":[]},{"bbox":null,"gaps":[],"id":"p003-u006","layer":"body","order":8,"page_id":"p003","review_status":"ai-initial-unreviewed","role":"body","text":"矣。雖李令巨富、然濟燃眉之難、應遽之援、終不喜也。但設宴欵","uncertainties":[]},{"bbox":null,"gaps":[],"id":"p003-u007","layer":"body","order":9,"page_id":"p003","review_status":"ai-initial-unreviewed","role":"body","text":"待朋友、濫費百金無妨。却貪戀紅塵、利慾薰心焉。只望遐齡長","uncertainties":[{"candidates":["長"],"length":1,"offset":27,"reason":"The last character of the column is incomplete because of the tear and repair at the lower frame edge. Only the upper-left strokes are visible."}]},{"bbox":null,"gaps":[],"id":"p003-u008","layer":"body","order":10,"page_id":"p003","review_status":"ai-initial-unreviewed","role":"body","text":"命壽歡娛樂矣。然因戀酒迷花、精神損毫、不期成病、命若懸絲。","uncertainties":[]},{"bbox":null,"gaps":[],"id":"p003-u009","layer":"body","order":11,"page_id":"p003","review_status":"ai-initial-unreviewed","role":"body","text":"且那個酒友終無來見他問候。李令吃驚暗想道、有酒有肉多","uncertainties":[]},{"bbox":null,"gaps":[],"id":"p003-u010","layer":"body","order":12,"page_id":"p003","review_status":"ai-initial-unreviewed","role":"body","text":"兄弟、患難何曾見一人。至于那個劉岱、若富隣擺酒席、唱戲鼓","uncertainties":[]},{"bbox":null,"gaps":[],"id":"p004-u001","layer":"body","order":13,"page_id":"p004","review_status":"ai-initial-unreviewed","role":"body","text":"樂不敢來自享、只看他病疾危篤、自然慇懃奉侍且說、李令懷","uncertainties":[{"candidates":["看","着"],"length":1,"offset":8,"reason":"The upper part of the glyph could be either 看 or 着; check against a detail crop."}]},{"bbox":null,"gaps":[],"id":"p004-u002","layer":"body","order":14,"page_id":"p004","review_status":"ai-initial-unreviewed","role":"body","text":"味世俗之心、想今日之危非力可救。但我死了、身空魂亡。劉岱","uncertainties":[]},{"bbox":null,"gaps":[],"id":"p004-u003","layer":"body","order":15,"page_id":"p004","review_status":"ai-initial-unreviewed","role":"body","text":"、道神魂人人主宰之靈亙古亙今、所不能滅、萬世無疆之休矣。","uncertainties":[]},{"bbox":null,"gaps":[],"id":"p004-u004","layer":"body","order":16,"page_id":"p004","review_status":"ai-initial-unreviewed","role":"body","text":"、他道、余想其陰魂於九泉之下遭苦、只是虛誕未稽之言也。劉","uncertainties":[]},{"bbox":null,"gaps":[],"id":"p004-u005","layer":"body","order":17,"page_id":"p004","review_status":"ai-initial-unreviewed","role":"body","text":"岱說道、人之所語無憑無據、晚生也不敢易信。然將聖書之傳","uncertainties":[]},{"bbox":null,"gaps":[],"id":"p004-u006","layer":"body","order":18,"page_id":"p004","review_status":"ai-initial-unreviewed","role":"body","text":"而篤信之、最有理也。且說李令自知命在旦夕、甚畏永亡、願識","uncertainties":[]},{"bbox":null,"gaps":[],"id":"p004-u007","layer":"body","order":19,"page_id":"p004","review_status":"ai-initial-unreviewed","role":"body","text":"死後之情、祈劉岱說一遍。他道、上帝之子耶穌教曰、昔有富人","uncertainties":[{"candidates":["敎","教"],"length":1,"offset":21,"reason":"The left component of the glyph resembles 數. It is read as a variant form of 教, but the exact form needs checking against a detail crop."}]},{"bbox":null,"gaps":[],"id":"p004-u008","layer":"body","order":20,"page_id":"p004","review_status":"ai-initial-unreviewed","role":"body","text":"穿紅袍衣細布、日日飲食繁華快樂。又有某貧人、渾身滿瘡、倒","uncertainties":[]},{"bbox":null,"gaps":[],"id":"p004-u009","layer":"body","order":21,"page_id":"p004","review_status":"ai-initial-unreviewed","role":"body","text":"富人門前矣。且富人棹下屑物、貧人願得之、以充饑、連狗亦來","uncertainties":[]},{"bbox":null,"gaps":[],"id":"p004-u010","layer":"body","order":22,"page_id":"p004","review_status":"ai-initial-unreviewed","role":"body","text":"舌舐其瘡也。適貧人死、爲天使帶起、放在先祖之心懷。富人亦","uncertainties":[]},{"bbox":null,"gaps":[{"cause":"image-insufficient","extent":"unknown","offset":0,"reason":"Only part of the centre-fold strip at the right edge is captured. The ink traces cannot be read as characters or counted."}],"id":"p004-u011","layer":"running-title","order":23,"page_id":"p004","review_status":"ai-initial-unreviewed","role":"running-title","text":"□","uncertainties":[]},{"bbox":null,"gaps":[],"id":"p005-u001","layer":"body","order":24,"page_id":"p005","review_status":"ai-initial-unreviewed","role":"body","text":"死葬埋。且陰間受苦、舉目遥見貧人在先祖之心懐矣。遂喊曰、","uncertainties":[{"candidates":["遥","遙"],"length":1,"offset":12,"reason":"整頁視圖下字形近遥，筆畫細部未能放大確認"},{"candidates":["懐","懷"],"length":1,"offset":21,"reason":"右旁簡省寫法，正異體碼位未能從整頁圖確定"}]},{"bbox":null,"gaps":[],"id":"p005-u002","layer":"body","order":25,"page_id":"p005","review_status":"ai-initial-unreviewed","role":"body","text":"吾祖乎、矜憐我、差貧人指頭點水、致凉吾舌。蓋此火焰中、吾誠","uncertainties":[{"candidates":["凉","涼"],"length":1,"offset":17,"reason":"左旁看似兩點，整頁圖下未能確定"},{"candidates":["。","．"],"length":1,"offset":20,"reason":"舌字下方的符號墨色偏重，是圈還是實心點不定"}]},{"bbox":null,"gaps":[],"id":"p005-u003","layer":"body","order":26,"page_id":"p005","review_status":"ai-initial-unreviewed","role":"body","text":"受苦矣。先祖曰、兒也可記素在世間、爾有好處、惟貧人不幸而","uncertainties":[{"candidates":["、","．"],"length":1,"offset":7,"reason":"曰字左下的符號看似實心點，形狀不定"}]},{"bbox":null,"gaps":[],"id":"p005-u004","layer":"body","order":27,"page_id":"p005","review_status":"ai-initial-unreviewed","role":"body","text":"今其得安樂、惟爾受苦矣。另有一件、隔我等有深淵、自我渡爾","uncertainties":[{"candidates":["、","．"],"length":1,"offset":5,"reason":"樂字旁的符號形狀不定，可能是實心點"},{"candi